+#    - The new behavior is easy to spot: previously unrelated sprites disappeared; now their colored
+#      border remains with an empty middle. Since every sample has multiple such sprites, the rule
+#      is inferable from 2-3 examples.
+# f) Visual cleanliness
+#    - No new overlays are introduced. Ghost sprites occupy the exact same footprint as the input
